# Loose screenshots dropped in the repo root. Browser tooling defaults here when given a
# bare filename, and the autosave hook will commit whatever it finds — which is how scratch
# files reached the live site once already (see 46c794c). Root only: Assets/Image stays tracked.
/*.png
